(A multicentre investigation examined a graded activity programme against standard care in 89) Tj
T*
(adults with chronic low back pain. The primary analysis indicated a modest improvement for) Tj
T*
(pain-related function, while treatment exposure and adverse events were broadly comparable) Tj
T*
(between groups. The findings should be considered alongside short follow-up and incomplete) Tj
T*
(adherence data. Differences in adherence were more pronounced among participants recruited) Tj
T*
(through community services. This report is from a parallel-group randomized controlled trial) Tj
T*
(comparing Control: placebo education vs Intervention: CBT + strength and balance exercise.) Tj
